 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Unmei no Tsugai? Naraba Sono Akai Ito Toyara Kirisutete Sashiagemashou"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "運命の番？ならばその赤い糸とやら切り捨てて差し上げましょう@COMIC"
   },
   {
    "en": "If This Is the Thread of Fate, Then I Will Cut It for You"
   },
   {
    "en": "Thread of Fate? Well Then, I Shall Cut It off"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"I'll send you to hell with all your 'love.'\"\n\nA snappy and pure-hearted queen judges evil in a stealthy manner! Painful! A fantasy about stealing the country! Includes a special manga and a novel newly written by the original author!\n\nThe world is populated by four humanoid races. Jeremiah, the princess of the human race, marries the king of the beastmen race for political reasons, but she is treated as an obstacle. She is sent away to a remote palace, and even her wedding night is skipped without her permission. The cause of all this is the king's mating partner, Yumir, and King Calvin, who is obsessed with her! \"Then, good riddance, I'll break off your bad karma with the whole country!\" Jeremiah uses his wits, his determination, and his dark weapons to expose the \"evil\" that has infested the country. The out-of-control and pure-hearted queen is quietly punishing the evil!\n\nA fantasy about stealing the kingdom!",
   "ja": "４つの人型種族が住む世界。人族の王女エレミヤは、政略のため獣人族の王に嫁ぐも邪魔者扱いされてしまう。挙句、離宮へと追いやられ、初夜さえ無断ですっぽかされる始末――。全ての原因は、王の運命の番(つがい)、ユミルと、彼女にうつつを抜かすカルヴァン王！「ならば上等、お前たちの悪縁、国ごと断ってやりましょう！」持ち前の智慧と負けん気、そして暗器で、エレミヤは国に蔓延（はびこ）る「悪」を暴き出す。ブチ切れ純情王妃が忍びやかに悪を制裁!? 痛快！ 国盗りファンタジー！"
  },
